<img src="propXIII10a.gif" alt="image detail" align="right" vspace="5" hspace="5">

The diagram is a little small to see detail. Part of it is expanded to the right.

#### Use of this proposition

This result is used in @XIII.16 for the construction of an icosahedron and later in @XIII.18 when an icosahedron is compared to the other four regular polyhedra.

